{
  "about": "What sells on a Precursor Tablet besides the craft you were aiming at — priced by Dorian on the trade site (instant buyout, 10 uses left) and sorted into four tiers. The Tablets tab shows each entry's odds of turning up while you roll, with a trade search and a box for the price you see. An entry is a SET that has to be on the tablet at once, on the tablets it names; a modifier can carry the value(s) that were priced, because \"rerolling Favours 3 additional times\" sells for more than 1. Left out: what he found at ~1 chaos (every Ritual pair of the non-jackpot modifiers, one extra random Modifier alone on Ritual) and what he did not price, which he said means ~1 chaos.",
